# Frontend

- Fetch `/api/*` (Next rewrites to FastAPI). No client-side running balances.
- Shared table: `CashflowView` for bank and cards. Expenses: `RecurringTable` + `OneOffTable`. Setup: balances, model start/end, `CreditCardSetup`.
- Account colors: `lib/accountStyle.ts` — Scotia `#c42b2b`, TD `#187a3c`.
- Keep redirects for `/cashflow`, `/cc-cashflow`, `/recurring`, `/one-off`, `/settings`.
